cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GEONE, please cite this software and the relevant methodological
  references listed in the documentation. Record the version or commit used.
type: software
title: "GEONE: Geostatistical modeling tools"
authors:
  - family-names: Straubhaar
    given-names: Julien
  - family-names: Renard
    given-names: Philippe
repository-code: "https://github.com/randlab/geone"
url: "https://geone.readthedocs.io"
abstract: >-
  GEONE provides Python tools for geostatistical modeling, including
  multiple-point and two-point statistics, simulation, kriging, and
  algorithms based on random processes.
keywords:
  - geostatistics
  - multiple-point statistics
  - simulation
  - kriging
